menu "Display hardware (Waveshare 2.8C)"

    config DISPLAY_HW_BOUNCE_BUFFER_LINES
        int "RGB bounce buffer height in lines"
        default 20
        range 0 120
        help
            Two internal-RAM bounce buffers of 480 x N pixels are used to stream the PSRAM
            framebuffer to the RGB bus. 0 disables them, which is known to make the image
            drift with a 64 B data cache line and 80 MHz PSRAM.

    config DISPLAY_HW_TOUCH_USE_INTERRUPT
        bool "Read GT911 on its interrupt line (GPIO16)"
        default y
        help
            When enabled the LVGL adapter reads the touch controller only after an INT edge.
            Disable to poll it on every LVGL input cycle, as the previous port did.

    config DISPLAY_HW_TOUCH_RESET_WAIT_MS
        int "GT911 wait after reset release, in ms"
        default 200
        range 10 500
        help
            Time between releasing GT911 reset and releasing INT. 200 ms matches the previous
            board definition.

endmenu
